            "reviews_json": "[\n  {\n    \"label\": \"Hardcore thrillseekers\",\n    \"quote\": \"I tried many products nothing beats this. This three in one does suction clamp pulse at once. I yell max it out and it hits the top like crazy. My mind goes blank. So addictive yeah totally addictive.\",\n    \"author\": \"Roxy, 31\",\n    \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0775/2446/7967/files/03_6b5a08a8-d865-408b-96b6-57fe6c986ec1.jpg?v=1781180898\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"Privacy Seekers\",\n    \"quote\": \"I hate loud devices my roommate has super ears. This one uses voice. I whisper lower or stop and it listens. One time she knocked I whispered lights off and it stopped. She thought I was on a call. That safe feeling matters more than physical sensation I think.\",\n    \"author\": \"Chloe, 24\",\n    \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0775/2446/7967/files/05.jpg?v=1781181815\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"Variety Seekers\",\n    \"quote\": \"Regular products are boring just three speeds. This one has different AI personalities gentle bossy or teasing. He controls the pace like a blind date. After two weeks it feels like experiencing many personalities no need to text back.\",\n    \"author\": \"Mia, 29\",\n    \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0775/2446/7967/files/01_580590cf-69a2-412c-913a-7d7555e4a601.jpg?v=1781245153\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"AI Geeks\",\n    \"quote\": \"It really learns what I like no fake smart stuff. After a few uses it remembers my slow then fast pattern. Just say softer or harder and it gets it. Works better every time.\",\n    \"author\": \"Nova, 37\",\n    \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0775/2446/7967/files/02_ab0ad54f-d8c4-4cda-86ef-28ebfb34b7cc.jpg?v=1781248912\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"label\": \"Roleplay lovers\",\n    \"quote\": \"I give the orders – it listens and follows right away. A whisper, a word, and it responds like it knows what I want. No delay, just pure reaction. Every time I play back my voice, it feels like I directed my own close audio drama.\",\n    \"author\": \"Ivy, 27\",\n    \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0775/2446/7967/files/04_7d939289-c021-4173-9a82-45a13ab236d2.jpg?v=1781249127\"\n  }\n]",
